-- GENERATED by `python src/config_repo.py --emit-sql` from that module's
-- SEED_PARAMS.  Do not hand-edit.
--
-- Applying it to an instrument seeds any parameter the config table is
-- missing, and is a no-op for those it already has:
--
--     sqlite3 src/colorimeter.sqlite < provisioning/config_defaults.sql
--
-- It never touches another table, and never overwrites a value the
-- operator set on Menu -> Config.  To drop those overrides as well, use
-- the Config screen's Restore, or:
--
--     UPDATE config SET active = 0 WHERE active = 1 AND source = 'operator';
--     UPDATE config SET active = 1 WHERE isdefault = 1;
--
-- The same block is embedded in src/db_DDL.sql, so a database built from
-- that file alone is already seeded.
-- ==========================================================================

